      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 8 dpa, the Hf-modified alloy will contain significantly fewer or smaller Cr-V-rich precipitates than unmodified W38Ta36Cr15V11.",
